### Registro de Usuario
POST http://localhost:5116/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Juan Pérez",
  "email": "juan.perez@example.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "confirmPassword": "Password123"
}

### Login de Usuario
POST http://localhost:5116/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "juan.perez@example.com",
  "password": "Password123"
}

